  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: 5 * 14 * 11 * 9 * 10 * 82 \n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ×, −, −, +, =\n\n⇒ **5 × 14** - 11 - 9 + 10 = 82 \n\n⇒ **70** - 20 **+ 10** = 82\n\n⇒ **80 - 20** = 82\n\n⇒ 60 ≠ 82\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ×, ×, −, +, =\n\n⇒ **5 × 14 × 11** - 9 + 10 = 82 \n\n⇒ **770** - 9 **+ 10 **= 82\n\n⇒** 780 - 9 **= 82\n\n⇒ 771 ≠ 82\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) **×, +, −, +, =**\n\n⇒** ****5 x 14** + 11 - 9 + 10 = 82 \n\n⇒ **70 + 11 **-9 **+ 10 **= 82\n\n⇒ **91 - 9** = 82 \n\n⇒ **82 = 82**\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) ×, +, −, ×, =\n\n⇒ **5 × 14** + 11 - **9 × 10** = 82 \n\n⇒ **70 + 11 **- 90 = 82\n\n⇒ 81 - 90 = 82\n\n⇒ -9 ≠ 82\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
